          <li>Merton Council Trading Standards, third-party websites (not illegal if upfront; can't mislead you into thinking they're official). <strong>Primary (public body).</strong> <a href="https://news.merton.gov.uk/2014/03/17/council-warns-residents-of-third-party-websites/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Merton Council</a></li>
          <li>Bath &amp; North East Somerset Council, warning about unofficial payment websites for PCNs and Clean Air Zone charges (may fail to pay on your behalf, leading to a PCN). <strong>Primary (public body).</strong> <a href="https://newsroom.bathnes.gov.uk/node/31741" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Bath &amp; North East Somerset Council</a></li>
          <li>Cheshire West and Chester Council, fake parking fine text scam (17 June 2026). <strong>Primary (public body).</strong> <a href="https://www.cheshirewestandchester.gov.uk/news/council-warns-drivers-of-parking-fine-text-scam-1" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Cheshire West and Chester Council</a></li>
          <li>Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea, parking fine scams (8 January 2026; updated 20 January 2026). <strong>Primary (public body).</strong> <a href="https://www.rbkc.gov.uk/newsroom/parking-fine-scams" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Royal Borough of Kensington and Chelsea</a></li>
          <li>Hertsmere Borough Council, scam text message about a PCN (genuine notices give car, contravention, time and date; forward to 7726). <strong>Primary (public body).</strong> <a href="https://www.hertsmere.gov.uk/news/warning-issued-over-scam-text-message" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Hertsmere Borough Council</a></li>
          <li>The Star (Sheffield), fake "Parking Charge Reminder" emails using a real parking company's name; Action Fraud advice. <strong>Secondary (news).</strong> <a href="https://www.thestar.co.uk/news/warning-over-fake-parking-ticket-emails-scam-57674" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">The Star</a></li>
          <li>Heathrow Airport, Terminal Drop-Off Charge Terms and Conditions (the official "Heathrow Website" is <a href="http://www.heathrow.com/dropoff" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">www.heathrow.com/dropoff</a>). <strong>Primary.</strong> <a href="https://www.heathrow.com/terms-and-conditions/terminal-drop-off-charge-terms-and-conditions" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Heathrow terms and conditions</a></li>
          <li>Fleet News, RAC drop-off charge analysis (at Heathrow and Gatwick you can't pay in person; pay online on the official airport website or by phone). <strong>Secondary (news).</strong> <a href="https://fleetnews.co.uk/news/drivers-warned-of-increasing-airport-drop-off-charges" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Fleet News</a></li>
          <li>Citizens Advice, "Appealing a parking ticket" (free to appeal; paying is usually seen as admitting the ticket was right; complaints via the consumer service). <strong>Primary.</strong> <a href="https://www.citizensadvice.org.uk/law-and-courts/parking-tickets/appealing-a-parking-ticket/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Citizens Advice</a></li>
        </ol>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
